function NavManagerV3({data,setData}:{data:SiteData;setData:(d:SiteData)=>void}){const[open,setOpen]=useState<string|null>(data.nav[0]?.id||null);const change=(i:number,x:any)=>{const a=[...data.nav];a[i]={...a[i],...x};setData({...data,nav:a})};return <section className="settings-card"><div className="section-head"><div><h2>目錄頁籤管理</h2><p>主要頁籤 {data.nav.length}/8；每頁最多 5 個小頁籤</p></div><Toggle on={data.announcement.visible} setOn={v=>setData({...data,announcement:{...data.announcement,visible:v}})} label="公告跑馬列"/></div>{data.nav.slice(0,8).map((n,i)=><div className="nav-editor" key={n.id}><div className="nav-summary"><span className="drag">⠿</span><input value={n.label} onChange={e=>change(i,{label:e.target.value})}/><input value={n.url} onChange={e=>change(i,{url:e.target.value})}/><span className="badge">{n.children?.length||0}/5 小頁</span><Toggle tone="blue" on={n.visible} setOn={v=>change(i,{visible:v})}/><button onClick={()=>setOpen(open===n.id?null:n.id)}>{open===n.id?"收合":"詳情"}</button><button onClick={()=>setData({...data,nav:data.nav.filter((_,x)=>x!==i)})}>移除</button></div>{open===n.id&&<div className="child-list">{(n.children||[]).map((x,j)=><div key={j}><span className="drag">⠿</span><input value={x} onChange={e=>change(i,{children:(n.children||[]).map((v,k)=>k===j?e.target.value:v)})}/><input defaultValue={`${n.url}/${j+1}`}/><Toggle tone="blue" on={true} setOn={()=>{}}/><button onClick={()=>change(i,{children:(n.children||[]).filter((_,k)=>k!==j)})}>移除</button></div>)}{(n.children?.length||0)<5&&<button onClick={()=>change(i,{children:[...(n.children||[]),"新小頁籤"]})}>＋ 增加小頁籤</button>}</div>}</div>)}{data.nav.length<8&&<button className="wide-add" onClick={()=>setData({...data,nav:[...data.nav,{id:`nav-${Date.now()}`,label:"新頁籤",url:"#new",visible:true,children:[]}]})}>＋ 增加主要頁籤</button>}</section>}

